Iridium 1.0.42 - Client Bot UI Redesign

✨ UI Improvements:
- Beautiful page headers with decorative frames
- Removed traffic info from profile (unlimited anyway)
- Moved login info to Support page (useful for troubleshooting)
- Added "Refresh info" button to update subscription status
- Color-coded subscription status (🟢 Active / 🟡 Expiring / 🔴 Expired)
- Cleaner layout with dividers and emoji indicators

🔧 Logic:
- Expired subscriptions keep user data, just show "expired" status
- Renewing adds days and restores access
